      "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/BvXr6Cjh3Pb/",
      "caption": "A Natureza \u00e9 formada por simples Leis Naturais de Vibra\u00e7\u00e3o, que regem tanto as escalas microsc\u00f3picas, subat\u00f4micas e astron\u00f4micas.\n\u3164\n\"Olhe profundamente para a natureza, e ent\u00e3o voc\u00ea entender\u00e1 tudo melhor.\" ~ Albert Einstein\n\u3164\n\ud83d\udcf8: Desconhecido(a)\n\u3164\n\ud83d\udc2f\ud83d\udc45\ud83d\udd2c\ud83d\udd2d\ud83c\udf00\n\u3164\n#GeometriaSagrada #GeometriaVortex #LinguagemDaLuz #Padr\u00e3oDaCria\u00e7\u00e3o #SacredGeometry #Natureza #Vibra\u00e7\u00e3o #Frequencia #Ciclos #Energia #Manifesta\u00e7\u00e3o #Animal #Fauna #Tigre #Phi #Propor\u00e7\u00e3o\u00c1urea #Perfei\u00e7\u00e3o #Conex\u00e3o #SabedoriaTranscendental #CienciaEspiritual #Harmonia #Pureza #Mentalismo #Consciencia #Correspondencia #AsAbobeSoBelow #Hermetismo #Quadrivium"
