      "caption": "\"Creativity is intelligence having fun.\"\n~ Albert Einstein\n\n.\n\nImage: Binary finger print by #unknown\n\n.\n.\n.\n\n#binary #binarycode #fingerprint #mathematics #math #numbers  #maths #education#ilovemath #mathisfun #matema\u0301ticas #matematicas #mathteacher  #calculus #mathematical #illustration"
